---
import Layer from '../../diagrams/Layer.astro';
---

<figure class="xp-platform-diagram lg:uno-ml-auto lg:uno-max-w-[40rem]" aria-labelledby="platform-layers-title">
  <figcaption class="xp-platform-diagram__header">
    <p class="xp-platform-diagram__eyebrow" id="platform-layers-title">Platform layers</p>
    <span class="xp-platform-diagram__scale" aria-hidden="true">CSS layer model</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="xp-platform-stack" aria-describedby="platform-layers-summary">
    <div class="xp-platform-stack__axis" aria-hidden="true">
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
    </div>

    <Layer title="Applications" eyebrow="User space" tone="applications" width="min(25rem, 78%)" shift="-1.2rem" zIndex={4}>
      <p>Application software sits above platform-owned boundaries instead of defining them.</p>
      <div class="xp-layer-chips" aria-label="Example application workloads">
        <span>UX</span>
        <span>Telemetry</span>
        <span>Services</span>
      </div>
    </Layer>

    <Layer title="Guest systems" eyebrow="Domains" tone="guests" width="min(29rem, 88%)" shift="0.3rem" zIndex={3}>
      <p>Linux, RTOS workloads, and service domains can keep separate runtime and hardware assumptions.</p>
      <div class="xp-domain-strip" aria-label="Example guest domains">
        <span>
          <i class="xp-domain-glyph xp-domain-glyph--linux" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          Linux
        </span>
        <span>
          <i class="xp-domain-glyph xp-domain-glyph--rtos" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          RTOS
        </span>
        <span>
          <i class="xp-domain-glyph xp-domain-glyph--services" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          Services
        </span>
      </div>
    </Layer>

    <Layer title="Xen hypervisor" eyebrow="Isolation boundary" tone="xen" width="min(31rem, 94%)" shift="-0.2rem" zIndex={2}>
      <p>Scheduling, isolation, device assignment, and platform control stay visible close to hardware.</p>
      <div class="xp-boundary-meter" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </div>
    </Layer>

    <Layer title="Hardware platform" eyebrow="Shared compute" tone="hardware" width="min(33rem, 100%)" shift="0.6rem" zIndex={1}>
      <p>Compute, memory, interrupts, peripherals, and SoC integration remain explicit system design inputs.</p>
      <div class="xp-hardware-row" aria-label="Hardware resources">
        <span>CPU</span>
        <span>Memory</span>
        <span>I/O</span>
      </div>
    </Layer>
  </div>

  <p class="xp-platform-diagram__summary" id="platform-layers-summary">
    Xen separates application workloads, guest domains, hypervisor control, and shared hardware into visible platform layers.
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .xp-platform-diagram {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.35rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(198 214 235 / 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--xp-radius-lg);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 74% 18%, rgb(133 194 65 / 0.16), transparent 32%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.03), transparent 38%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(11 19 32 / 0.82), rgb(5 8 14 / 0.22));
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0.85rem;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(198 214 235 / 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(rgb(198 214 235 / 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 2.75rem 2.75rem;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(130deg, transparent 0%, black 26%, black 70%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram__header {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram__eyebrow,
  .xp-platform-diagram__scale {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--xp-accent-primary);
    font-family: var(--xp-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram__scale {
    color: var(--xp-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .xp-platform-stack {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: clamp(30rem, 58vw, 39rem);
    align-content: center;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.6rem) 0 clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .xp-platform-stack__axis {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 7% 12% 5% 12%;
    z-index: 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    pointer-events: none;
    transform: perspective(58rem) rotateX(54deg) rotateZ(-24deg);
  }

  .xp-platform-stack__axis span {
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgb(133 194 65 / 0.34), rgb(103 217 223 / 0.28), transparent);
  }

  .xp-layer-chips,
  .xp-domain-strip,
  .xp-hardware-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .xp-layer-chips span,
  .xp-hardware-row span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.22rem 0.52rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.16);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.06);
    color: var(--xp-text-primary);
    font-family: var(--xp-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .xp-domain-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    max-width: 20rem;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .xp-domain-strip span {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    min-width: 0;
    color: var(--xp-text-primary);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .xp-domain-glyph {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1.45rem;
    height: 1.45rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(103 217 223 / 0.72);
    background: rgb(103 217 223 / 0.08);
  }

  .xp-domain-glyph--linux::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0.36rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(103 217 223 / 0.54);
  }

  .xp-domain-glyph--rtos {
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .xp-domain-glyph--rtos::before,
  .xp-domain-glyph--rtos::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    background: rgb(103 217 223 / 0.72);
  }

  .xp-domain-glyph--rtos::before {
    inset: 0.45rem;
  }

  .xp-domain-glyph--rtos::after {
    inset: -0.22rem 0.62rem;
    box-shadow:
      -0.42rem 0.44rem 0 -0.13rem rgb(103 217 223 / 0.72),
      0.42rem 0.44rem 0 -0.13rem rgb(103 217 223 / 0.72),
      -0.42rem 0.88rem 0 -0.13rem rgb(103 217 223 / 0.72),
      0.42rem 0.88rem 0 -0.13rem rgb(103 217 223 / 0.72);
  }

  .xp-domain-glyph--services {
    border: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(150deg, transparent 42%, rgb(103 217 223 / 0.72) 42% 48%, transparent 48%),
      linear-gradient(30deg, transparent 42%, rgb(103 217 223 / 0.72) 42% 48%, transparent 48%);
  }

  .xp-domain-glyph--services::before,
  .xp-domain-glyph--services::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0.25rem 0.12rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(103 217 223 / 0.68);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(103 217 223 / 0.68);
    transform: skewY(-25deg);
  }

  .xp-domain-glyph--services::after {
    inset: 0.58rem 0.12rem -0.04rem;
  }

  .xp-boundary-meter {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    max-width: 17rem;
    gap: 0.42rem;
  }

  .xp-boundary-meter span {
    height: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(133 194 65 / 0.62);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(133 194 65 / 0.45), rgb(133 194 65 / 0.1));
  }

  .xp-hardware-row span {
    border-color: rgb(208 223 122 / 0.2);
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram__summary {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .xp-platform-diagram {
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: var(--xp-radius-md);
    }

    .xp-platform-diagram::before {
      inset: 0.65rem;
      background-size: 2rem 2rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .xp-platform-diagram__header {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .xp-platform-diagram__scale {
      display: none;
    }

    .xp-platform-stack {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .xp-platform-stack__axis {
      display: none;
    }

    .xp-domain-strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media print {
    .xp-platform-diagram {
      border: 1px solid #9ca3af;
      background: transparent;
    }

    .xp-platform-diagram::before,
    .xp-platform-stack__axis {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
